      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A report is given on experiences with complications after antirabic treatment with hempt-vaccine gathered during 15 years (1960 to 1974). Among 4,315 inoculated persons local reactions appeared in 1.9%, a phenol shock in 0.11%, general reactions in 0.21% and neurological complications in 0.069%. In casuistic form is reported on postvaccinal neuritis, dorsolumbal myelitis and meningoencephalitis."},
